# Shopify Storefront

Public barrel `src/lib/shopify/index.ts` exports `shopifyFetch`, `shopifyConfig`, `getProducts`, `getProduct`, `getCollectionProducts`, `getProductRecommendations`, `searchProducts`, `predictiveSearchProducts`, `fetchShopifyNavItems`, `COLLECTION_HANDLES`. Cart actions and `getCatalogPage` are **not** on that barrel.

| Import from | Symbols |
| --- | --- |
| `@/lib/shopify` | Barrel list above |
| `@/lib/shopify/catalog` | `getCatalogPage`, `CatalogPage`, `CatalogSource` |
| `@/lib/shopify/catalog-actions` | `loadMoreCatalog` |
| `@/lib/shopify/cart/actions` | `fetchCart`, `addToCartAction`, `buyNowAction`, checkout actions |
| `@/lib/catalog-params` | `parseCatalogSort`, `parseCatalogFilters`, `catalogHref` |

Env (server only): `SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN`, `SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_API_VERSION` (default `2025-10`). Endpoint is `https://{domain}/api/{version}/graphql.json`.

`shopifyFetch` POSTs `{ query, variables }`. Default cache is `revalidate: 3600`. A leading `mutation`, `cache: "no-store"`, or `revalidate: false` forces `no-store`. No cache tags. GraphQL `errors[0].message` is thrown. Callers of catalog queries catch and return empty data.

Map in `mappers/product.ts`. Card `id` = handle. Price is `minVariantPrice` parsed with `Number.parseFloat`. Images fall back to `/images/placeholder.jpg`. Color options are `color` or `colour` (`mappers/color.ts`); unknown names map to `#0C0C0C`. Detail fit/fabric/size chart come from `parseDescription(descriptionHtml)` (`description.ts`). Shipping/returns copy comes from `src/data/shipping-policy.ts` via `shippingCopy()`.

`getCollectionProducts` is a thin wrapper over `getCatalogPage({ source: { kind: "collection", handle }, limit })`. Missing collection → `[]`. `getCatalogPage` also supports `kind: "products"` (shop-all) and `kind: "search"`, plus cursor pagination, sort, and Shopify `ProductFilter` inputs. `getProductRecommendations` needs a GID (`product.gid`), not a handle.

`fetchShopifyNavItems` is unused. The header reads flat `NAV_ITEMS` from `src/data/navigation.ts`. PLPs call `getCatalogPage`. Home rails and the collection hub call `getCollectionProducts`.

Cart cookie `modimal_cart_id` stores only the cart id (httpOnly, 14 days). Mutations live in `mutations/cart.ts` and return `CartSummary` via `mapCart`. `checkoutUrl` is passed through. `cost.subtotalAmount` becomes `subtotal`. Do not map a payment or card field onto the cart.
